<section class="legal-page" data-reveal>
  <header class="legal-page__header">
    <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
    <p class="legal-page__meta">Information under Art. 13 GDPR</p>
  </header>

  <article class="legal-page__content">
    <section>
      <h2>1. Data controller</h2>
      <p><%= cfg.impressumProviderName || 'EasySupport' %><br>
      <%= cfg.impressumProviderAddress || '123 Example Street' %><br>
      <%= cfg.impressumProviderCity || '12345 Example City' %><br>
      Email: <%= cfg.impressumProviderEmail || 'privacy@example.com' %></p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>2. Collection and storage of personal data</h2>
      <p>When using our Discord bot and website, the following data is processed:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Discord user data:</strong> User ID, username, avatar, discriminator (for authentication via Discord OAuth2)</li>
        <li><strong>Server and channel information:</strong> Guild IDs, channel IDs, role IDs (for ticket management and module configuration)</li>
        <li><strong>Ticket data:</strong> Messages, attachments, metadata (for transcripts and moderation)</li>
        <li><strong>Technical data:</strong> IP address (temporarily for security), user agent, timestamps</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>3. Purpose of data processing</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Providing the ticket system and moderation tools</li>
        <li>Authentication and authorization via Discord OAuth2</li>
        <li>Creation of transcripts and logs</li>
        <li>Security and abuse prevention (anti-spam, anti-raid)</li>
        <li>Statistics and service improvement</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>4. Legal bases</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Art. 6(1)(b) GDPR (contract performance)</li>
        <li>Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR (legitimate interest in security and operation)</li>
        <li>Art. 6(1)(a) GDPR (consent for optional data)</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>5. Data sharing</h2>
      <p>Data is shared with third parties only:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>With Discord Inc. as part of OAuth2 authentication and the bot API</li>
        <li>When legally required or to enforce rights</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>6. Data retention</h2>
      <p>Data is deleted once it is no longer required for the purpose of its collection. Ticket transcripts are archived after closure and then deleted according to the configured retention period (<%= cfg.dataRetentionDays || 90 %> days).</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>7. Your rights</h2>
      <p>You have the right to access, rectify, erase, restrict processing, data portability, and object. Contact us at <%= cfg.impressumProviderEmail || 'privacy@example.com' %>.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>8. Right to complain</h2>
      <p>You have the right to complain to a data protection supervisory authority.</p>
    </section>
  </article>

  <footer class="legal-page__footer">
    <p>Last updated: <time datetime="2026-01-01">January 2026</time></p>
    <p><a href="/">← Back to home</a></p>
  </footer>
</section>